Ain't he just the best? C'mon, get the little guy to work!!
Oh and in case you haven't figured it out yet, use WASD to move the camera around!
Use your MOUSE WHEEL to zoom in and out! And then LEFT CLICK on your little guy to see his stats, and then RIGHT CLICK anywhere to make him walk!
Also! If you want to select more troops, hold LEFT CLICK and DRAG!
That should be it I think, also speaking of your little guy...
I suggest you put him near some TREES or MINERALS to get the resource production going! But do what you want!